// Title: Console CodePage Lookup Via CHCP
// Rule ID: 7090adee-82e2-4269-bd59-80691e7c6338
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1614.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_chcp_codepage_lookup.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
